[0.167, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[2d\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[?1006h\u001b[?1000h\u001b[?1002h\u001b[?1003h"]
[0.085, "o", "\u001b[3B\u001b[97mSingle\u001b[1m RC4 key\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m CgeOvEO7hu\u001b[97m @ 0x14007d6e0; all ~270 embedded strings are base64(RC4) blobs decrypted pre-main (decryptor @ 0x140007d04, RC4 @\r\n0x140023048). All plaintexts recovered and published. Detector's 18 \"candidate keys\" were ciphertext fragments. Build/campaign ID:\u001b[93m 512e7bd984984fb6\r\n\u001b[97m(plaintext).\u001b[9;1H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## 6. Anti-analysis\u001b[11;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m- \u001b[1mCIS kill-switch\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m: exits on LANGIDs 0x419/0x422/0x423/0x43F/0x443 (RU/UA/BY/KZ/UZ), before any C2 contact\r\n- \u001b[1mNamed-event single-instance guard\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (\u001b[93m<%p>_<Computer>_<User>\u001b[97m, with a developer bug formatting a function pointer)\r\n- \u001b[1mDate kill-switch\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m: hardcoded expiry \u001b[1m11 April 2025\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m assembled from 4 RC4 blobs (@ 0x14002a774)\r\n- No anti-VM, no HAL9TH/JohnDoe check, no anti-debug beyond CRT (verified negatives)\u001b[16;1H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## 7. Injection\u001b[18;1H\u001b[97mEarly-Bird APC injection\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (@ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m0x14003a048): CreateProcess suspended → VirtualAllocEx RWX → WriteProcessMemory of the embedded 64-bit helper DLL\r\n(pre-mapped, sRDI reflective loader appended) → QueueUserAPC. The helper uses the\u001b[1m IElevator COM service\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m to decrypt Chrome's app-bound key and returns\r\nit over a volume-serial-derived named pipe. Optional\u001b[93m runas\u001b[97m elevation for loader tasks; no other privilege escalation.\u001b[22;1H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## 8–9. IOCs & Attribution\u001b[24;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mFull list in forum post\u001b[1m #final-iocs\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m; attribution evidence (YARA ×3, protocol, builder path, typo\u001b[93m Error dumping proccess list\u001b[97m) in\u001b[1m #final-verdict\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m.\r\nNote: the oft-cited \"GetCerrentProcessId\" typo is\u001b[1m not\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m in this build — the earlier claim was corrected by byte-level re-verification.\u001b[27;1HAll 15 questions raised were solved with byte-level evidence; detector false positives (ransomware, fake ADD/XOR decodes) were explicitly refuted,\r\nand low-confidence items (IElevator GUID naming, event-name %p bug) were flagged for analyst review.\u001b[30;1H🤖\r\nResuming analysis…\u001b[33;1H\u001b[36m┌\u001b[1m Prompt \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[34;1H│\u001b[90mHow can Thorium help?                                                                                                                               \u001b[36m│\u001b[35;1H│\u001b[90m                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[36;1H│\u001b[90m                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[37;1H│\u001b[90m                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[38;1H│\u001b[90m                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[39;1H│\u001b[90m                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[40;1H└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[41;1H\u001b[90m───────────────────────────"]
